{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"IMPLEMENTATION NOTE — one deviation from the plan, recorded for the close gate.\n\nThe plan named 14 packages for tier-1 promotion; the landed change promotes **13**. `reducer`\nis EXCLUDED. Its single un-annotated def is `reducer._filters.match_predicate(value)`, whose\ntype depends on the `op` argument (scalar / iterable / (lo,hi) pair). `value: object` was\ntried and produced 7 real mypy errors in the body; `value: Any` would satisfy tier 1 while\nbuying neither driver — the exact failure mode cc77 documents. Papering over it would have\nviolated the plan's own no-new-Any acceptance criterion, so it was filed instead:\nlegged-tenuous-bonobo (d893-e003-0539-47fc), linked discovered_from.\n\nThe larger residue (llm 293 / _commands 146 / _engine 134 untyped defs, ~390 explicit Any) is\nfiled as acute-agitable-xiphosuran (003c-2dd2-203a-4725), also linked discovered_from.\n\nMeasured result: tier 1 goes 2 -> 13 packages; tier 2 (`disallow_any_explicit`, new) covers\n`rebar._cli.*` and `rebar._snapshot.*`. Repo-wide explicit-Any count unchanged (no new Any\nintroduced by the 36 annotations)."},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1786649327374035001,"uuid":"f28f8f35-95fc-40bd-8a9b-9b35fe917437"}